---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section style="max-width: 760px; padding-top: 4rem;">
    <h1 style="
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    ">
      Financials.
    </h1>

    <p style="
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    ">
      ETHOS is designed to compound value through alignment,
      not extract it through attention.
    </p>

    <!-- Model -->
    <div style="
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      max-width: 680px;
    ">
      <strong>Revenue model</strong>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        Businesses pay for aligned visibility within ETHOS.
        Users never pay with attention, data, or manipulation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Economics -->
    <div style="
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      max-width: 680px;
    ">
      <strong>Unit economics</strong>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        Software-first delivery creates high operating leverage.
        Margins improve as signal density increases.
      </p>
      <ul style="margin-top: 1rem; padding-left: 1rem;">
        <li>No content farms</li>
        <li>No moderation armies</li>
        <li>No paid acquisition dependency</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Costs -->
    <div style="
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      max-width: 680px;
    ">
      <strong>Cost structure</strong>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        Focused on product quality and system depth.
      </p>
      <ul style="margin-top: 1rem; padding-left: 1rem;">
        <li>Infrastructure</li>
        <li>Research and system refinement</li>
        <li>Core product engineering</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Use of funds -->
    <div style="
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      max-width: 680px;
    ">
      <strong>Use of funds</strong>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        Capital is deployed to deepen signal,
        not accelerate noise.
      </p>
      <ul style="margin-top: 1rem; padding-left: 1rem;">
        <li>Signal validation and density</li>
        <li>Experience quality</li>
        <li>Long-term system integrity</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Closing -->
    <div style="
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 3rem;
      max-width: 560px;
    ">
      <p>
        ETHOS optimizes for durability —
        not short-term extraction.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
